# Title: Suspicious Workstation Locking via Rundll32
# ID: 3b5b0213-0460-4e3f-8937-3abf98ff7dcc
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-06-04
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects a suspicious call to the user32.dll function that locks the user workstation
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((cmdline:*user32.dll,*) AND ((process_name:*\\rundll32.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"RUNDLL32.EXE")) AND (parent_name:*\\cmd.exe) AND (cmdline:*LockWorkStation*))
